[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Purpose

[TEXT]
STATEMENT: >>>
The purpose of this document is to outline the design specifications of the Heracles HVPS Interface
Bootloader Firmware.
<<<

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Scope

[TEXT]
STATEMENT: >>>
This document describes the design modules and sub-modules of the Heracles HVPS Interface
Bootloader Firmware.
The information in this document is derived from the HVPS Interface Bootloader FW SRS, referenced in
this document.

\*The term Software applies to both Software and Firmware components.
<<<

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Abbreviations and Definitions

[TEXT]
STATEMENT: >>>
FW
  Firmware

MCU
  Microcontroller Unit

PRS
  Product Requirements Specification

SDP
  Software Development Plan

SRS
  Software Requirements Specification

SW
  Software
<<<

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Overview

[TEXT]
STATEMENT: >>>
The HVPS Interface Bootloader firmware allows the system to be able to update the HVPS Interface
application firmware. The HVPS Interface Bootloader firmware runs on the MCU of the HVPS interface
board.
<<<

